        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六赛季，九站ATP一千赛全部打完。九座奖杯，只分给了五个人。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
